    <h1>Wix vs. <em>a custom-coded site built to bring in calls</em></h1>
    <p>Wix costs little up front, and you can have a site live in a weekend. For a new business, that's a strength. This page compares something else: how many paying customers each kind of site brings in over a year.</p>
  </div>
