    <h2>What one extra call a week is worth</h2>
    <p>Most service businesses judge a website by its price. A better measure is what each visitor is worth: a commercial roofing job runs several thousand dollars, an HVAC install more, and a landscape build five figures.</p>
    <p>In a worked example for a typical local business, a $500 average job and one extra call a week come to $26,000 a year in potential work. At $5,000 a job, it's 10 times that. So the choice between Wix and me comes down to which site puts more customers on your calendar.</p>

